  "_comment": [
    "Stories in the order they happened, for put-in-order. The generator deals",
    "out several handfuls from each timeline, so a timeline wants six or more",
    "events: fewer and the handfuls repeat each other.",
    "",
    "Only put an event here if its place in the order is not in dispute. Where",
    "scholars argue over which came first, a group will too, and the reveal",
    "cannot settle it. The references are where each event is told, so the",
    "reveal can point at them."
